msgid "ElevenLabs API Key"
msgstr "ElevenLabs API-sleutel"

msgid "&API key:"
msgstr "&API-sleutel:"

msgid "Paste your ElevenLabs API key first."
msgstr "Plak eers jou ElevenLabs API-sleutel."

msgid "Checking the API key with ElevenLabs..."
msgstr "Kontroleer die API-sleutel by ElevenLabs..."

msgid "The API key could not be checked. See the NVDA log for details."
msgstr "Die API-sleutel kon nie gekontroleer word nie. Sien die NVDA-log vir besonderhede."

msgid "The API key could not be saved. See the NVDA log for details."
msgstr "Die API-sleutel kon nie gestoor word nie. Sien die NVDA-log vir besonderhede."

msgid "ElevenLabs TTS"
msgstr "ElevenLabs TTS"

msgid "Clear &API key"
msgstr "Vee &API-sleutel uit"

msgid "Set &API key..."
msgstr "Stel &API-sleutel..."

msgid "Clear the ElevenLabs API key? ElevenLabs can't speak until a new key is set."
msgstr "Vee die ElevenLabs API-sleutel uit? ElevenLabs kan nie praat totdat 'n nuwe sleutel gestel is nie."

msgid "The API key could not be cleared. See the NVDA log for details."
msgstr "Die API-sleutel kon nie uitgevee word nie. Sien die NVDA-log vir besonderhede."

msgid "ElevenLabs rejected this API key. Check that it was copied in full and that it is allowed to read voices."
msgstr "ElevenLabs het hierdie API-sleutel geweier. Kontroleer dat dit volledig gekopieer is en dat dit stemme mag lees."

msgid "ElevenLabs could not check the key (HTTP {code}). Try again later."
msgstr "ElevenLabs kon nie die sleutel kontroleer nie (HTTP {code}). Probeer later weer."

msgid "Could not reach ElevenLabs to check the key. Check your internet connection and try again."
msgstr "Kon nie ElevenLabs bereik om die sleutel te kontroleer nie. Kontroleer jou internetverbinding en probeer weer."

#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
msgid "Speech synthesizer driver that streams audio from the ElevenLabs text-to-speech API."
msgstr "Spraaksintetiseerderdrywer wat klank vanaf die ElevenLabs teks-na-spraak-API stroom."

#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
msgid ""
"All settings and messages within the add-on are now localized.\n"
"If the ElevenLabs API suddenly becomes unavailable during a session, NVDA now reverts to using eSpeak instead of becoming silent."
msgstr ""
"Alle instellings en boodskappe in die byvoeging is nou gelokaliseer.\n"
"As die ElevenLabs-API skielik tydens 'n sessie onbeskikbaar raak, skakel NVDA nou oor na eSpeak in plaas daarvan om stil te raak."
